  "who": "rill"
 },
 "let's add commas the way each headquarters needs, to make the reports easier to read!": {
  "file": "rill-e36b9eba86.m4a",
  "ms": 4911,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "both headquarters follow a different way of grouping digits.": {
  "file": "rill-600ae179d2.m4a",
  "ms": 3387,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "indian headquarters uses thousands, lakhs and crores to read large numbers.": {
  "file": "rill-ef4e9e1900.m4a",
  "ms": 4920,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "start from the right. count three digits and put a comma. this is the ones group.": {
  "file": "rill-43bc6f9c3e.m4a",
  "ms": 5127,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "now count two digits and put another comma. this is the thousands group.": {
  "file": "rill-fe266861fb.m4a",
  "ms": 4374,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "count two more digits for the lakhs group. the remaining digit is in crores!": {
  "file": "rill-45038d59c0.m4a",
  "ms": 4581,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "we read this as four crore thirty-two lakh fifty-six thousand seven hundred eighty-one.": {
  "file": "rill-eeb7c79e0f.m4a",
  "ms": 5151,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "international headquarters uses thousands, millions and billions. here, commas follow a different pattern!": {
  "file": "rill-468cdbf097.m4a",
  "ms": 6893,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "start from the right again. count three digits and put a comma. this is the ones group.": {
  "file": "rill-d2a529d64b.m4a",
  "ms": 5510,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "now count three more digits and add a comma. this is the thousands group.": {
  "file": "rill-d63f26f8fc.m4a",
  "ms": 4409,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "the remaining 43 belongs to the millions group. for even bigger numbers, we use billions!": {
  "file": "rill-dd2ed35a8d.m4a",
  "ms": 6023,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "we read this as forty-three million two hundred fifty-six thousand seven hundred eighty-one.": {
  "file": "rill-81c23355b5.m4a",
  "ms": 5256,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "indian grouping uses three digits, then pairs of two. international grouping uses groups of three throughout!": {
  "file": "rill-f2858733f8.m4a",
  "ms": 6789,
  "who": "rill"
 },
 "now prepare the population reports for both headquarters!": {
  "file": "rill-0fca8d7d11.m4a",
  "ms": 3387,
  "who": "rill"
 },
